# B0-r3 owner repair, review candidate only

August29,2026. Olddb630/7dc and independent3/9 remain unchanged. All39 product
calls/install/RegexWorkers/internal loaders/guest engines remain UNRUN.

Owner-only changes: capture descriptors enter ownership immediately; second open
failure closes the first. Every owner capture/event/JSON write completes with
positive bounded progress or fails. Attempted and stored capture bytes are distinct.
Presence flags preserve raw0/false/null/undefined/empty-string primaries; later
capture/observer/close faults remain separate recorded reasons. Manager abort closes
the event descriptor on setup/phase failure. Observation faults cannot skip the
known-child teardown attempt. Unknown close/group/descriptor state is NOT clean.

One monotonic start is taken in bootstrap before admission, passed to run and the
owner. Absolute inclusive ceiling1800s, active deadline1620s,180s reserved for
cleanup/publication; cleanup at most5s per failure (TERM immediately,KILL after2s,
unknown at5s). Install ceiling120s; each of three layouts420s; each case30s.
Effective child timer is min(role ceiling,remaining ACTIVE budget). Setup consumes
the SAME active budget. Publication is checked before and after file persistence
against the same absolute deadline; it is not a reset clock. Synchronous host FS
operations cannot be forcibly preempted; overdue return is non-success. No hard
kernel/preemption/full-descendant claim. Publication errors may prevent a terminal
record; outer raw capture remains required and no success can then be inferred.

File policy: complete write, fsync, close for owner events/captures/JSON; no claim
of directory-fsync/power-loss durable publication. Primary stays raw; secondary
publication/cleanup reasons are recorded where persistence is available. Safety/
capture/integrity/unknown retirement ends dependent work, never permission widening.

The fixed four-role graph and32-known-OS/peak3,64MiB capture/768MiB work proposal
remain. Four roles are one offline install+three13-case layouts. Default80/source
3adc309/full1014SHA2fe071e2 remain byte-identical. Source-built uses actual StageA
emissions, installed uses offline scripts-disabled npm and moved is a real rename.
No product or fixture change. Original scripts C01–09,C12–14,C17 are unchanged.

Inherited Regex resources/loader are unchanged:2/layout6total,live2; fixed3
internal loader admissions separately; no guest Worker. Same static closure and
main-loader evidence, NOT nested-worker load proof. No comparator profile.

Control preseal:16 groups A(old6),I01(raw falsy5 incloriginal4),I02(Error),I03(short
AB),I04(second open),I05(spawn),I06(exit1),W-zero,W-invalid,P-primary/cleanup,
T-inclusive,T-reserve,T-publication,F-eventflush,F-abort/publication,R-role/group.
One harmless Node controller links the WHOLE shipping owner module with synthetic
io/spawn/kill dependencies. Zero real child spawns/signals/native FD injections;
fake descriptors/group absence are POLICY UNIT observations, not OS protection.
Admission group alone performs actual bounded preseal reads. Tool is existing
pinned Node22.22.2; no compiler/npm/product/native/private/network execution.

Fresh root actual39 GO remains required after independent review. No aggregate
coherent acceptance: largerStageB/all50Unit2/layout/types/mutants/PUBLIC95 remain.

